  Text: "It's a service station lazily named \"Petro Station\". \n  \nWe've left
    not much untouched. There where some cameras but they are gone now. There is
    a public <link>bathroom</link> at the side of the building. That's fortunate
    in case we have to stay here for too long. "
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
